+entry = '2026-10-14 BCA01-BCA03/G01/R01/Q01: owner rejects glass crash cues on clear bridge entrances/exits. Cell-centre/supporting-span visible-body checks remove original113 false cues across180 physically clear all-car sweeps; each final renderer has zero crashes and360 quiet recorded body contacts. Original23players/24MiB/128probes/all118 bank hashes, real rail/underside impacts, Desert sand and canonical behavior retained. Dedicated42184headless/42184+5Compatibility/42189Mobile; bridge16/scrape602/vehicle1469/Desert67/parser765 pass. Separate wall test1/5 failure is trace-identical with original pre-task methods; assertion retained. Native before impact_1 becomes two chassis cues, zero crash PCM/exact pause/unclipped. Actual commands/initial fixture/filter corrections/scoped checkpoint: docs/BRIDGE_CONTACT_AUDIO_2026_10_14.md. No phone/APK/deploy/FPS or subjective acceptance claim.\n\n'
+
+def read(name): return (root/name).read_text(encoding='utf-8')
+
+modified = {}
+for name in ['AGENTS.md', 'DEVELOPMENT_STATUS.md', 'docs/PHASE_0_PLAN.md']:
+    source = read(name)
+    if name == 'AGENTS.md':
